<title>UK: Two Brent cargoes kept ahead of deadline.</title>
<headline>Two Brent cargoes kept ahead of deadline.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The two Brent cargoes turning wet on Monday were kept ahead of the five o'clock deadline by Morgan Stanley and Koch, traders said. Both cargoes are due to load June 17-19 and one of them was a deferral from Friday. --London newsroom, +44 171 542 8145</p>
